HivePulse 1.0.0

Scan the QR code on a hive, log the visit, done. Big buttons for gloves, works without a signal.

New in this build:
• The beekeeper's year: a timeline of what to do and when, shifted to your location
• Add a hive by hand, no sticker needed
• Move a hive from its own page
• Polish as a fifth language
• A softer regional health map
• Fixes for language and Settings

